nodes.body:
@claude

The optimizer side state dict padding & unpadding complexity is way too much for a repo who claims itself as simple & clean.

Is there no way that we can deal with it cleanly without hacking components/optim/ folder? At the very least, the optimizer state dict hooks should belong to fused qkv linear's own module / file, rather than making a general util only for one single module.

